; DT818_pro_v2.1 - 6-stream ORB rank portfolio (no hedge), 6.0% total per setup
; Generated 2026-05-09. Range filter disabled 2026-05-13.
;
; RANGE FILTER: DISABLED (Min=0, Max=999999) per WFO 2026-05-13 Option A.
;   See 9pct setfile header for full sim result. At 6pct, expected NP ~2/3 of 9pct
;   numbers, NP/DD$ ratio stays roughly the same.
;
; Architecture (weekly Sat reopt):
;   S1/S2/S3 (magics 1111/2222/3333): PREVIOUS-week WFO top 3 (MAY2)
;   S4/S5/S6 (magics 4444/5555/6666): CURRENT-week  WFO top 3 (MAY9)
; _RiskPct = 1.0 per stream so total when all 6 fire together = 6.0%.
;
; PREVIOUS week (wfo_orb_may2):
;   S1 rank 1: Range=90/SL=500/RR=4.0/HTP=0.25  P0=PASS slope=+78%
;   S2 rank 2: Range=90/SL=400/RR=4.0/HTP=0.0   P0=PASS slope=+52%
;   S3 rank 3: Range=90/SL=350/RR=4.0/HTP=0.5   P0=PASS slope=+4%
;
; CURRENT week (wfo_orb_may9):
;   S4 rank 1: Range=90/SL=650/RR=4.0/HTP=0.25  P0=PASS slope=+24%
;   S5 rank 2: Range=90/SL=350/RR=4.0/HTP=0.5   P0=FAIL slope=-71%
;   S6 rank 3: Range=90/SL=400/RR=4.0/HTP=0.5   P0=FAIL slope=-75%
;
; Spread guard: _MaxSpreadPts=60 (Vantage max observed 32pt; bumped 50->60 on 2026-05-15 to match SIM_SPREAD_PTS=60 in WFO friction)

